---
source: src/completion/engine.rs
expression: "output.join(\"\\n\")"
---
-b	Select a boot offset (0 is current, -1 is previous)	options	space
--boot	Select a boot offset (0 is current, -1 is previous)	options	space
-f	Stream new entries and updated stories until interrupted	options	space
--follow	Stream new entries and updated stories until interrupted	options	space
-h	Print help	options	space
--help	Print help	options	space
--last-outage	Show only the most recent outage (alias for --outages --limit 1)	options	space
-n	Maximum stories or raw entries to show (1-2000; default 20)	options	space
--limit	Maximum stories or raw entries to show (1-2000; default 20)	options	space
-o	Show only power outages, blips, and shutdowns	options	space
--outages	Show only power outages, blips, and shutdowns	options	space
-r	Show source journal messages instead of stories	options	space
--raw	Show source journal messages instead of stories	options	space
-s	Include entries since a journalctl time (for example, 'today' or '-2h')	options	space
--since	Include entries since a journalctl time (for example, 'today' or '-2h')	options	space
--ascii	Use ASCII symbols and bars	global options	space
--color	Color output policy	global options	space
-c	Read host settings from this file	global options	space
--config	Read host settings from this file	global options	space
-j	Emit machine-readable JSON where supported	global options	space
--json	Emit machine-readable JSON where supported	global options	space
-v	Include additional diagnostic detail	global options	space
--verbose	Include additional diagnostic detail	global options	space
